  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4298c1582b1a1b6428acd6f21334c2fe, type: 3}
  m_Name: YatElder
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Name:
    textVI: "Yat Gi\xE0"
    textEN: Yat Elder
  CharSprite: {fileID: 5938750416960775255, guid: 0123a67d83e2e494d9186a8036194936, type: 3}
  DialogueLines:
  - IsYou: 0
    textVI: "SInh v\u1EADt h\u1EA1 \u0111\u1EB3ng l\xF4ng l\xE1 kh\u1ED1n ki\u1EBFp,
      mau bi\u1EBFn ra kh\u1ECFi v\xF9ng \u0111\u1EA5t n\xE0y!"
    textEN: You filthy, furry subhuman creature!! Begone from this land at once!
    autoSkip: 0
  - IsYou: 1
    textVI: "N\xE0y , l\xE3o gi\xE0. T\xF4i kh\xF4ng bi\u1EBFt ch\u1ED7 t\u1ED1i
      t\u0103m n\xE0y v\u1EABn c\xF2n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi s\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1EA5y. Mau
      cho t\xF4i bi\u1EBFt \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 \u0111\xE2u, n\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng t\xF4i
      \u0111\u1EADp n\xE1t c\xE1i l\xE0ng n\xE0y ra \u0111\u1EA5y!"
    textEN: Hey, old timer. I didn't know anyone actually lived in this dump. Tell
      me where this is, or I'll tear this village to pieces!
    autoSkip: 0
  - IsYou: 0
    textVI: "Ng\u01B0\u01A1i... H\u1EEB, l\u0169 sinh v\u1EADt h\u1EA1 \u0111\u1EB3ng
      c\xE1c ng\u01B0\u01A1i l\xFAc n\xE0o c\u0169ng t\u1ECF v\u1EBB cao cao t\u1EA1i
      th\u01B0\u1EE3ng. C\xE1i t\xEAn kh\u1ED1n ki\u1EBFp l\u1EA7n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      c\xF2n kh\xF4ng cao ng\u1EA1o b\u1EB1ng ng\u01B0\u01A1i."
    textEN: You... Damn you! You arrogant bastards always think you're above everyone
      else. Even that bastard from before wasn't as arrogant as you.
    autoSkip: 0
  - IsYou: 1
    textVI: "C\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE3 t\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EBFn \u0111\xE2y
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc t\xF4i \xE0? N\xF3i \u0111i h\u1EAFn tr\xF4ng nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF
      n\xE0o? V\xE0 \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 \u0111\xE2u?"
    textEN: So someone else has been here before me... Tell me, what did that bastard
      look like? And where are we?!
    autoSkip: 0
  - IsYou: 0
    textVI: "H\u1EEB, t\xEAn kh\u1ED1n \u0111\xF3 \u0111\xE3 ph\xE1 h\u1EE7y m\u1ECDi
      th\u1EE9, sau \u0111\xF3 bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t d\u1EA1ng. H\u1EAFn l\xE0 t\xEAn
      \u0111i\xEAn!"
    textEN: Humph! That jerk destroyed everything, then vanished into thin air..
      He was a madman!
    autoSkip: 0
  EndDialogue: 
  AutoProgressDelay: 1.5
  TypingSpeed: 0.02
  VoiceSound: {fileID: 0}
  VoicePitch: 1
  IsActivated: 0
